partners, modest SCP (net cash): 0.5% [Assumption]\n- WACC = 4.71% + 1.05 \u00d7 4.5% + 0.5% = 9.94% \u2192 9.9% (50% CI: 8.8-11.0%)\n\n3-2 Revenue Forecast\n\n| FY | Revenue | Growth | Source |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| 2025A | $1.837B | +7.1% | [Actual] |\n| 2026E | $1.93B | +4.8% | H1 actual +5.4%/4.1% + guidance mid-single-digit; assumes 5% in H2 |\n| 2027E | $2.01B | +3.9% | My assumption: occupancy gains saturate; pricing lags wage inflation |\n| 2028E | $2.08B | +3.5% | [Assumption] \u2014 demographic demand offsets saturation |\n| 2029E | $2.15B | +3.0% | [Assumption] |\n| 2030E | $2.21B | +3.0% | [Assumption] |\n\nTerminal growth: 2.5% (nominal GDP - 150bp) [Assumption]\n\nSensitivity: If revenue post-2027 compounds at 5%, IV rises ~12%; at 1%, IV falls ~22% (incl. AY).\n\n3-3 Margin Forecast\n\n- Gross margin (cost of services): 2025 actual 84.6% \u2192 85.5% (2026 company goal ~86%) \u2192 85.8% (2027) \u2192 85.5% (terminal) [Actual guidance 2026; Assumption 2027+ based on no long-run structural change]\n- 2026 implied gross margin 14.5%; 2027 14.2%; terminal 14.5%\n- SG&A: 2025 actual ~10.4%; 2026 company goal 9.5-10.5%; terminal 9.5% [Company guidance + my assumption]\n\nOperating margin path:\n2026: 4.9% (14.5% - 9.6%) [Estimate]\n2027: 4.8% [Assumption]\n2028: 4.9% [Assumption]\nTerminal: 5.0% (14.5% - 9.5%) [Assumption]\n\nAssumption label: this margin path is NOT an extrapolation of company guidance \u2014 company guidance confirms only 2026 cost ranges. Post-2026 margins are my assumptions.\n\n3-4 EPS/FCFE Forecast and Valuation\n\n| FY | Rev | OI margin | OI | D&A | Capex | \u0394WC | Tax | NI | FCFE |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 2026E | $1.93B | 4.9% | $94.5M | $18M | $7M | $20M | 25% | $70.9M | ~$78M |\n| 2027E | $2.01B | 4.8% | $96.2M | $18M | $7M | $12M | 25% | $72.2M | ~$68M |\n| 2028E | $2.08B | 4.9% | $101.9M | $18M | $7M | $10M | 25% | $76.4M | ~$74M |\n| 2029E | $2.15B | 4.9% | $105.4M | $18M | $7M | $8M | 25% | $79.1M | ~$80M |\n| 2030E | $2.21B | 5.0% | $110.6M | $18M | $7M | $6M | 25% | $82.9M | ~$87M |\n\nCapex: $6M/history [Actual], maintenance-only. D&A: $17M/history [Actual]. \u0394WC: positive (payroll accrual) but normalizing [Assumption]. Tax: 25% company guidance [Actual].\n\nTerminal value (Gordon): FCFE 2031 = $89M; g=2.5%; WACC 9.9% \u2192 TV = $1.25B.\n\nPV of explicit + TV: \u2248 $1.48B\nPlus: Net cash $168M, plus short-term investments $43M = +$168M incremental (using only cash + STI, not overlapping lease adj. \u2014 see below)\nFair value \u2248 $1.65B\nShares: 68.0M\nIV per share \u2248 $24.00 [Estimate]\n\n3-5 Cross-Checks\n\n- P/E: 2026 EPS \u2248 $1.04 (diluted weighted ~68M); Fwd P/E 21.9x vs 5-yr avg ~15x \u2192 Implied IV if re-rates to 17x: $17.70\n- EV/EBITDA: 2026 EBITDA $112.5M; EV at T0 $1.38B \u2192 12.3x vs 5-yr avg ~8x \u2192 Implied IV ~$18\n- Reverse DCF: current price implies 5-yr FCF growth ~10%/yr and margin >6% \u2014 infeasible absent margin innovation [Estimate]\n- Asset/replacement floor: Equity $284M + brand/contract intangible ~$200-300M adjusted = ~$7.1-8.6/sh [Assumption]\n\n3-6 Tornado Sensitivity \u2014 Top 3\n\n1. WACC (8.8\u201311.0%): IV changes \u00b1$5.50/sh\n2. Terminal margin (4.0\u20136.0%): IV changes \u00b1$3.00/sh\n3. FCFE growth 2026-30 (0\u20136%): IV changes \u00b1$2.50/sh\n\nThese three become Thesis KPIs.\n\n\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\n\u25a0 SECTION 3.5. SECOND-ORDER EFFECTS\n\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2